Package: golang-github-codegangsta-cli-dev
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, golang-github-urfave-cli-dev
Description: compatibility package for the legacy codegangsta/cli import path
 This package provides the historical Go import path
 github.com/codegangsta/cli for projects that still reference it.
 The implementation is provided by the Debian 13
 golang-github-urfave-cli-dev package.
